  License:   MIT
  Upstream:  https://bellard.org/quickjs/
  Copyright: (c) 2017-2021 Fabrice Bellard and Charlie Gordon

  **Verification gap.** The `flutter_js` package ships only its own MIT
  LICENSE file; it carries no QuickJS license text alongside the prebuilt
